# 敏感包清单：这些包升级可能覆盖 L540 本地补丁依赖的库/服务，或被卸载会破坏构建环境。
# apt Pre-Install-Pkgs 钩子按本清单在终端提示；snapshot 按本清单记录版本基线；
# 基线中的包被卸载时 hisi-patch-check 报警（只报警，不自动重装）。
treeland
treeland-data
treeland-wallpaper-factory
network-manager
libnm0
wpasupplicant
libwayland-client0
libwayland-egl1
libwayland-server0
libglvnd0
libegl1
libegl-mesa0
libgles2
libgbm1
libqt6gui6
ddm
lightdm
# 锁屏指纹 / 人脸图标（libtl-lockbio）用 QtQuick.Shapes 画；它是自动装上的依赖，autoremove 可能把它带走
qml6-module-qtquick-shapes
deepin-authenticate
deepin-face
dde-shell
dde-control-center
libmpv2
mpv
# 自编壁纸 factory（/usr/local/bin/treeland-wallpaper-factory）链接了 Qt WebEngine，被卸载壁纸就起不来
libqt6webenginecore6
libqt6webenginequick6
systemd
systemd-resolved
libc6
libdrm2
libssl3
bluez
# 手机指纹解锁给手机看的锁屏截图：grim 抓 PPM（它的 JPEG 支持没编进来），cjpeg 压成 JPEG
grim
libjpeg-turbo-progs
grub-common
grub2-common
grub-efi-arm64
grub-efi-arm64-bin
grub-efi-arm64-signed
grub-efi-arm64-unsigned
deepin-immutable-ctl
deepin-immutable-boot
linux-image-deepin-hwe-arm64
linux-image-6.6.159-arm64-desktop-hwe
clang
clang-17
lld
lld-17
cmake
ninja-build
